#: ../../CONTRIBUTING.md:2
msgid "Contributing"
msgstr "贡献指南"

#: ../../CONTRIBUTING.md:4
msgid ""
"Before changing this repository, read [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md). See the "
"[developer guide](docs/developer/development.md) for local setup, code "
"ownership, dependency boundaries, and checks for common changes."
msgstr ""
"动手改这个仓库之前，先读 "
"[AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md)。本地环境搭建、代码归属、依赖边界，以及常见改动要跑哪些检查，都在[开发者指南](docs/developer/development.md)里。"

#: ../../CONTRIBUTING.md:8
msgid "The short version"
msgstr "一句话流程"

#: ../../CONTRIBUTING.md:10
msgid ""
"Create a branch from `dev` named `<user>/<scope>/<name>`. Keep the change"
" focused on one feature, fix, or documentation update."
msgstr "从 `dev` 拉分支，命名为 `<user>/<scope>/<name>`。一次改动只做一件事：一个功能、一个修复，或一次文档更新。"

#: ../../CONTRIBUTING.md:12
msgid ""
"Run tests that cover the behavior you changed, and add coverage where "
"needed. Keep the tests strong: fix regressions instead of weakening "
"assertions just to make them pass."
msgstr "跑覆盖你所改行为的测试，缺的就补上。测试不能放水：出了回归就修代码，不要为了让测试通过而放宽断言。"

#: ../../CONTRIBUTING.md:15
msgid ""
"Keep affected contracts, migrations, and current-use documentation up to "
"date."
msgstr "受影响的契约、迁移和当前在用的文档，要一并更新。"

#: ../../CONTRIBUTING.md:17
msgid ""
"Run `make check` and any other checks the change requires. Review the "
"formatting and lint fixes it applies automatically."
msgstr "跑 `make check`，以及这次改动需要的其他检查。它会自动做格式化和 lint 修复，提交前看一遍改了什么。"

#: ../../CONTRIBUTING.md:19
msgid ""
"Open a pull request against `dev`. Describe the resulting behavior, and "
"list the checks you actually ran and their results."
msgstr "向 `dev` 发起 pull request。写清楚改完之后的行为，并列出你实际跑过的检查和结果。"

#: ../../CONTRIBUTING.md:22
msgid ""
"Use conventional commit format for commit subjects and PR titles: "
"`type(scope): summary`. Pull requests are squash merged, so the PR title "
"becomes the commit subject on `dev`. `main` advances through the manual "
"[fast-forward workflow](.github/workflows/sync-main.yml)."
msgstr ""
"commit 标题和 PR 标题都用 conventional commit 格式：`type(scope): summary`。Pull "
"request 用 squash 方式合并，所以 PR 标题就是 `dev` 上那条 commit 的标题。`main` 通过手动触发的 "
"[fast-forward 工作流](.github/workflows/sync-main.yml)往前推进。"

#: ../../CONTRIBUTING.md:27
msgid ""
"Treat every commit as public. Never commit secrets, tokens, or keys. "
"Before submitting, use the [PR "
"checklist](.github/pull_request_template.md) to review the diff. "
"[MIGRATION.md](MIGRATION.md) documents the completed repository "
"extraction. Its move-only restrictions are historical, but the service "
"and security boundaries in `AGENTS.md` still apply."
msgstr ""
"每个 commit 都要当成公开内容对待，绝不能提交 secret、令牌或密钥。提交前，对照 [PR "
"检查清单](.github/pull_request_template.md)把 diff "
"过一遍。[MIGRATION.md](MIGRATION.md) 记录的是已经完成的仓库拆分；里面\"只搬不改\"的限制已成历史，但 "
"`AGENTS.md` 里的服务边界和安全边界依然有效。"

#: ../../CONTRIBUTING.md:33
msgid "Checks before review"
msgstr "提交评审前的检查"

#: ../../CONTRIBUTING.md:35
msgid "Run these backend commands from the repository root:"
msgstr "在仓库根目录运行这些后端命令："

#: ../../CONTRIBUTING.md:42
msgid ""
"Use `make setup-dev` for the initial environment setup. `make check` "
"formats, lints, and type-checks all three Python packages. It also runs "
"tests, excluding the `external` and `dbtest` tiers."
msgstr ""
"第一次搭环境用 `make setup-dev`。`make check` 会对三个 Python 包做格式化、lint "
"和类型检查，并跑测试（不含 `external` 和 `dbtest` 两个层级）。"

#: ../../CONTRIBUTING.md:46
msgid "For frontend changes, also run:"
msgstr "改了前端，还要跑："

#: ../../CONTRIBUTING.md:57
msgid ""
"CI also runs build guards for server-only and runtime site configuration."
" If you change those boundaries, follow the [developer "
"guide](docs/developer/development.md#run-the-relevant-checks) and run the"
" relevant guard locally."
msgstr ""
"CI 还会跑 server-only "
"和运行时站点配置的构建守卫。如果你动了这两处边界，请按[开发者指南](docs/developer/development.md#run-the-"
"relevant-checks)在本地跑对应的守卫。"

#: ../../CONTRIBUTING.md:62
msgid ""
"Use the [developer guide](docs/developer/development.md#run-the-relevant-"
"checks) to choose the database and external tests you need. Database "
"changes require the `dbtest` tier against a dedicated PostgreSQL test "
"database. Schema changes need an additive Alembic migration. Service "
"startup must not create or alter the schema."
msgstr ""
"需要跑哪些数据库测试和外部测试，参考[开发者指南](docs/developer/development.md#run-the-relevant-"
"checks)来选。改了数据库，就要用专门的 PostgreSQL 测试库跑 `dbtest` 层级。改 schema 要写增量的 Alembic"
" 迁移，服务启动时不能建表或改表。"

#: ../../CONTRIBUTING.md:68
msgid ""
"If you change environment variables, Compose files, Docker packaging, or "
"workflows, run the tests that verify their wiring. Document new variables"
" in [ENVIRONMENT.md](ENVIRONMENT.md). Update the documentation in the "
"same change when commands or behavior change."
msgstr ""
"如果改了环境变量、Compose 文件、Docker 打包或工作流，要跑验证这些配置是否接对的测试。新增的变量写进 "
"[ENVIRONMENT.md](ENVIRONMENT.md)。命令或行为变了，在同一次改动里更新文档。"

#: ../../CONTRIBUTING.md:73
msgid "Continuous integration"
msgstr "持续集成"

#: ../../CONTRIBUTING.md:75
msgid ""
"[CI](.github/workflows/ci.yml) classifies the changed paths and chooses "
"the backend, frontend, and image jobs to run. A pull request is compared "
"with its base, and a push with the newest `agent-*` release, so a "
"released commit has had every change since the previous release checked. "
"It uses Python 3.12 and Node.js 22. The `CI Gate` requires the classifier"
" to succeed. Every other job must either succeed or be deliberately "
"skipped."
msgstr ""
"[CI](.github/workflows/ci.yml) 会根据改动了哪些路径，决定要跑哪些后端、前端和镜像任务。pull request "
"和它的 base 比较，push 则和最新的 `agent-*` 发布比较，所以一个 commit "
"发布时，上次发布以来的所有改动都已经检查过。CI 用的是 Python 3.12 和 Node.js 22。`CI Gate` "
"要求路径分类这一步必须成功，其他任务要么成功，要么是按规则跳过的。"

#: ../../CONTRIBUTING.md:82
msgid ""
"Secret scanning and the default test tier run for every change: the "
"tier's tests also read documentation, `ENVIRONMENT.md` and the web app's "
"sources. Depending on the paths changed, other jobs cover backend "
"formatting, lint, mypy, the PostgreSQL test tier, frontend checks, "
"Compose rendering, image builds, and image smoke tests. CI also exercises"
" selected real CLI/session and MCP flows. After review, the real-Kata "
"candidate check runs for relevant `dev` commits. Pull-request image jobs "
"build and smoke-test without publishing."
msgstr ""
"secret 扫描和默认测试层级每次都会跑，这一层的测试还会读取文档、`ENVIRONMENT.md` 和 Web "
"应用的源码。其余任务视改动的路径而定，涵盖后端格式化、lint、mypy、PostgreSQL 测试层级、前端检查、Compose "
"渲染、镜像构建和镜像冒烟测试。CI 还会实际跑一部分真实的 CLI、会话和 MCP 流程。评审通过后，相关的 `dev` commit "
"会再跑一次真实 Kata 的候选检查。pull request 里的镜像任务只构建和冒烟测试，不发布。"

#: ../../CONTRIBUTING.md:91
msgid ""
"Every pull request, from a fork or from a branch here, runs on disposable"
" GitHub-hosted runners; pushes to `dev` and `main` run on the self-hosted"
" pools. Checked-in runner routing is not a security boundary: a fork can "
"edit it. Issue [#464](https://github.com/HarvardMadSys/hybridInference-"
"cloud-agent/issues/464) tracks the runner-group restrictions that are, "
"and the [developer guide](docs/developer/development.md#run-the-relevant-"
"checks) describes them. Release publication has its own "
"[workflow](.github/workflows/publish.yml) and "
"[guide](deploy/release/README.md)."
msgstr ""
"每个 pull request，不管来自 fork 还是本仓库的分支，都在用完即弃的 GitHub 托管 runner 上运行；推送到 `dev`"
" 和 `main` 则在自托管的 runner 池上运行。仓库里写的 runner 路由不算安全边界，因为 fork 可以随便改。真正起作用的是 "
"runner 组的限制，这项工作记录在 issue [#464](https://github.com/HarvardMadSys"
"/hybridInference-cloud-"
"agent/issues/464)，具体说明见[开发者指南](docs/developer/development.md#run-the-"
"relevant-"
"checks)。发布有自己的[工作流](.github/workflows/publish.yml)和[指南](deploy/release/README.md)。"

#: ../../CONTRIBUTING.md:100
msgid "Contracts"
msgstr "契约"

#: ../../CONTRIBUTING.md:102
msgid ""
"`gateway_contracts/*.openapi.yaml` records the Gateway HTTP APIs that "
"this service consumes. Check changes against the corresponding Gateway "
"source. If you change a client's endpoints or fields, update the relevant"
" contract in the same PR. Identify the Gateway change that it tracks. "
"Tests pin this service's side of the contract, but they cannot verify the"
" current implementation in another repository."
msgstr ""
"`gateway_contracts/*.openapi.yaml` 记录本服务调用的网关 HTTP "
"API，改动时要对照网关的源代码核实。如果改了某个客户端用到的端点或字段，就在同一个 PR "
"里更新对应的契约，并注明它对应网关的哪次改动。测试只能锁定本服务这一侧的契约，没法验证另一个仓库里当前的实现。"

#: ../../CONTRIBUTING.md:109
msgid ""
"`gateway_contracts/agent-control-plane.openapi.json` records this "
"service's own API. For an intentional change, regenerate it with [the "
"developer-guide command](docs/developer/development.md#changing-an-api). "
"Review the diff, and explain the compatibility implications in the PR."
msgstr ""
"`gateway_contracts/agent-control-plane.openapi.json` 记录本服务自己的 API。有意改 API"
" 时，用[开发者指南里的命令](docs/developer/development.md#changing-an-api)重新生成，看一遍 "
"diff，并在 PR 里说明对兼容性的影响。"

#: ../../CONTRIBUTING.md:114
msgid ""
"The shared Python protocols in `apps/backend/cloud_agent_shared/` form a "
"separate contract between the control plane and hosts. When you change "
"that boundary, review the protocol versions, capabilities, and runtime "
"pins together."
msgstr ""
"`apps/backend/cloud_agent_shared/` 里共用的 Python "
"协议，是控制平面和主机之间的另一份契约。动这条边界时，协议版本、能力声明和运行时版本固定要放在一起审视。"

